      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:d55137d9416711859ddac38f10bda496727bfe6c2b0b9062ccb001c61c533a11\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:565289f39955501a5abb682f50245716ec04f466a0e891f0e10b360acdc8c014\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:41fa295fe2a6446478b5aef1ddf6dcc7bc33c52ab6f56025f99b67b6c60b877f\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:5398fffe8cb08a2438e9ecb136e4a5bcd417f329fc7512192f7ca65d16f67440\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:3b3982d39c36fd1e7ff404ca95ab94a8ef520962aa41253b5829e5b7d2eaa1c2\"],\"choice_quote\":\"\",\"choice_text\":\"\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":941,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":941,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:579:941:sha256-b7b80f97588d13e2422c19992c15f3262fd999e2e3c0966b293b10977eb6bdd9\",\"quote\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"start\":579},{\"end\":941,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:579:941:sha256-b7b80f97588d13e2422c19992c15f3262fd999e2e3c0966b293b10977eb6bdd9\",\"quote\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"start\":579},{\"end\":604,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:598:604:sha256-f86b1f62a8554232b940f4fd9c8d6601aae4767456df3d6cdff55a51f17b5075\",\"quote\":\"should\",\"start\":598},{\"end\":539,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:436:539:sha256-7f0fa99d97951a139f33ec44a19b323846e2dfb0edb6a59ea10b8060a5799c86\",\"quote\":\"You must request a new photograph if the photograph submitted does not meet the following requirements:\",\"start\":436}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:34bcb1ea7303d88d28d81b4d47dac27e57eb7e5a4cc082289389d5ec55742590\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"recommendation\",\"logic_text\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:3b3982d39c36fd1e7ff404ca95ab94a8ef520962aa41253b5829e5b7d2eaa1c2\",\"modality\":\"should\",\"modality_quote\":\"should\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:eda60f64caaf2b63ba88533314def5d47e59c2d92ceb86020e6fccbcd82acd14\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"references\":[\"22 CFR 51.26\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:9eaebaa14e3e5ffbc0fe48d53fb26dbf5adb8d7631fe5851ab35abbed3cfcf1b\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"You must request a new photograph if the photograph submitted does not meet the following requirements:\"],\"scope_text\":\"For a photograph submitted with an application.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":579,\"summary\":\"The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of, and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
